sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PI as Raspberry Pi (saira-agent)
    participant ESP as esp32-server (:5005)
    participant WRK as yolo-worker (Funil A)
    participant AI as IA (Decisions / Bedrock / Vertex)
    participant DB as Postgres + Redis
    participant WEB as Backend + Painel Web

    Note over PI: RTSP substream atualiza latest.jpg<br/>Motion Gate (BGSUB 360p) detecta intrusão
    PI->>ESP: POST /upload-batch (X-Device-Id, event_id, frames + ref pré)
    ESP-->>PI: 200 OK (salva JPEGs e atualiza events/event_id.json)
    Note over PI: Cena acalma — fecha evento (end ou end_transient)
    PI->>ESP: POST /upload-batch (frame final, event_state=end)

    loop Varredura do worker (manifestos fechados ou stale)
        WRK->>WRK: Lê manifesto — descarta se transient ou menos de 3 frames
        WRK->>WRK: Subamostra até 48 frames (teto 8 MB) e avalia BGSUB
        WRK->>AI: 1. Decisions (gemini-decision-1, 5 frames, res. low)
        AI-->>WRK: score (0..1) — se < 0,30 em enforce, encerra janela
        WRK->>AI: 2. Gate Amazon Nova Lite (Bedrock, 5 frames 640px, v1p)
        AI-->>WRK: new_litter + confiança (dispara >= 85 · falha cai no Gemini)
        WRK->>AI: 3. Detail gemini-3.8-flash (Vertex, janela inteira, g3, timeout 90s)
        AI-->>WRK: infraction_confirmed + tipo, material, volume, infratores
    end

    alt Descarte confirmado
        WRK->>DB: INSERT detections, offenders, cascade_decisions, gemini_call_log
        WRK->>DB: INSERT notifications (por RPA) e PUBLISH Redis notifications:all
        WRK->>ESP: POST /device/id/trigger (CMD_PERSIST_CLIP:event_id)
        ESP-->>PI: Long-poll /poll entrega comando — Pi move clipe RAM para SD
        DB-->>WEB: SSE /api/v1/notifications/stream
        Note over WEB: Operador recebe alerta em tempo real e classifica a ocorrência
    else Sem descarte
        WRK->>DB: INSERT gemini_call_log (+ cascade_decisions se chegou ao Detail)
        WRK->>WRK: Move frames para sem_ocorrencia/
    end

    opt Operador solicita vídeo da ocorrência
        WEB->>ESP: POST /device/id/trigger (CMD_VIDEO_CLIP:event_id)
        ESP-->>PI: Long-poll entrega comando — Pi concatena cadeia MP4
        PI->>ESP: POST /device/id/video (MP4 até 300 MB)
        WEB->>ESP: Reproduz /uploads/videos/device/event_id.mp4
    end

    Note over WRK,DB: Diariamente às 03h BRT (D-1): sync S3 (ocorrencias/ e zip descartadas/) + atualização de image_url
